t adds the prices starting from zero.","claims":[{"claimId":"claim:637773fc-14ca-4c96-8c05-655acbc98272","category":{"kind":"codeBehavior"},"prose":"The exported `subtotal` accepts `prices` as a number array and declares a numeric return value.","anchors":[{"anchorId":"anchor:3d4357e5-4d61-4f9a-8874-54067e29a199","path":"cart.ts","symbolId":null,"snapshotId":"snap-1792133675714600000-43528-0","sourceSha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a","startByte":0,"endByteInclusive":51,"startLine":1,"endLine":1,"startColumn":1,"endColumn":52,"excerpt":"export function subtotal(prices: number[]): number {"}],"dependencies":[{"kind":"sourceFile","path":"cart.ts","source_sha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a"}]},{"claimId":"claim:6ca95e28-0576-4fc0-8da9-593238ba560f","category":{"kind":"codeBehavior"},"prose":"`subtotal` uses `prices.some` to detect any `price` that is non-finite or below zero, then throws `RangeError` with the displayed message.","anchors":[{"anchorId":"anchor:3da2844e-0662-43c6-9dda-b39f00df7a42","path":"cart.ts","symbolId":"sym:3502e10e881a48270a94a5f3a3f9ae96a41c5fa4541c59b5104ffd26f244bbbe","snapshotId":"snap-1792133675714600000-43528-0","sourceSha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a","startByte":53,"endByteInclusive":193,"startLine":2,"endLine":4,"startColumn":1,"endColumn":3,"excerpt":"  if (prices.some((price) => !Number.isFinite(price) || price < 0)) {\n    throw new RangeError(\"Prices must be finite and non-negative\");\n  }"}],"dependencies":[{"kind":"sourceFile","path":"cart.ts","source_sha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a"},{"kind":"symbol","path":"cart.ts","source_sha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a","symbol_id":"sym:3502e10e881a48270a94a5f3a3f9ae96a41c5fa4541c59b5104ffd26f244bbbe"}]},{"claimId":"claim:2c6a7989-827c-4796-ab2f-e688d4f206b5","category":{"kind":"codeBehavior"},"prose":"If the guard does not throw, `subtotal` returns `prices.reduce` with an initial accumulator of zero; each `price` is added to the running `total`. An empty array therefore returns zero.","anchors":[{"anchorId":"anchor:f4a8c464-cbe5-4131-bd19-349dd30f292e","path":"cart.ts","symbolId":"sym:3502e10e881a48270a94a5f3a3f9ae96a41c5fa4541c59b5104ffd26f244bbbe","snapshotId":"snap-1792133675714600000-43528-0","sourceSha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a","startByte":53,"endByteInclusive":193,"startLine":2,"endLine":4,"startColumn":1,"endColumn":3,"excerpt":"  if (prices.some((price) => !Number.isFinite(price) || price < 0)) {\n    throw new RangeError(\"Prices must be finite and non-negative\");\n  }"},{"anchorId":"anchor:b159c139-b555-4d19-bda6-069ed945da90","path":"cart.ts","symbolId":"sym:3502e10e881a48270a94a5f3a3f9ae96a41c5fa4541c59b5104ffd26f244bbbe","snapshotId":"snap-1792133675714600000-43528-0","sourceSha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a","startByte":195,"endByteInclusive":253,"startLine":5,"endLine":5,"startColumn":1,"endColumn":59,"excerpt":"  return prices.reduce((total, price) => total + price, 0);"}],"dependencies":[{"kind":"sourceFile","path":"cart.ts","source_sha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a"},{"kind":"symbol","path":"cart.ts","source_sha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a","symbol_id":"sym:3502e10e881a48270a94a5f3a3f9ae96a41c5fa4541c59b5104ffd26f244bbbe"}]}],"dependencies":[{"kind":"sourceFile","path":"cart.ts","source_sha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a"},{"kind":"symbol","path":"cart.ts","source_sha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a","symbol_id":"sym:3502e10e881a48270a94a5f3a3f9ae96a41c5fa4541c59b5104ffd26f244bbbe"}],"visual":{"schemaVersion":2,"kind":"dataFlow","title":"subtotal validation and accumulation","layoutHint":{"direction":"leftToRight"},"nodes":[{"nodeId":"visualnode:03d6b8ef-1a65-485a-acd5-f581982e4947","label":"prices","detail":"Input number array","hotspotId":"visualhotspot:761a660e-05d2-415a-9ed7-bf822f26884f","evidenceAnchorIds":["anchor:3d4357e5-4d61-4f9a-8874-54067e29a199"]},{"nodeId":"visualnode:cfc1b365-1454-42e9-99cf-d7d4662ef84e","label":"Validation","detail":"Check whether any price is non-finite or negative","hotspotId":"visualhotspot:85d466e0-e164-494e-9376-6d97ba615114","evidenceAnchorIds":["anchor:3da2844e-0662-43c6-9dda-b39f00df7a42"]},{"nodeId":"visualnode:0fdf1576-1c45-46c6-98b1-162bb7312be7","label":"RangeError","detail":"Rejected input takes the explicit error path","hotspotId":"visualhotspot:7486ce23-c051-4e3a-a06e-6b0ea3d1eace","evidenceAnchorIds":["anchor:3da2844e-0662-43c6-9dda-b39f00df7a42"]},{"nodeId":"visualnode:125172b2-ec6f-4fd9-b657-2efe9d945165","label":"Reduction and result","detail":"For accepted input, add from zero and return the numeric result","hotspotId":"visualhotspot:9cfc8732-5ddf-4121-b60b-75dd47fc65fe","evidenceAnchorIds":["anchor:b159c139-b555-4d19-bda6-069ed945da90","anchor:3d4357e5-4d61-4f9a-8874-54067e29a199"]}],"edges":[{"edgeId":"visualedge:6eed3d9d-c121-4016-8f31-b170518b0352","fromNodeId":"visualnode:03d6b8ef-1a65-485a-acd5-f581982e4947","toNodeId":"visualnode:cfc1b365-1454-42e9-99cf-d7d4662ef84e","label":"check entries","evidenceAnchorIds":["anchor:3da2844e-0662-43c6-9dda-b39f00df7a42"]},{"edgeId":"visualedge:325037c5-308c-44cf-90f1-09b1a9d8f6d5","fromNodeId":"visualnode:cfc1b365-1454-42e9-99cf-d7d4662ef84e","toNodeId":"visualnode:0fdf1576-1c45-46c6-98b1-162bb7312be7","label":"if any price is invalid","evidenceAnchorIds":["anchor:3da2844e-0662-43c6-9dda-b39f00df7a42"]},{"edgeId":"visualedge:1e2bf16f-f81e-4f73-b5e5-a01fcb7ed93e","fromNodeId":"visualnode:cfc1b365-1454-42e9-99cf-d7d4662ef84e","toNodeId":"visualnode:125172b2-ec6f-4fd9-b657-2efe9d945165","label":"if the guard does not throw, reduce","evidenceAnchorIds":["anchor:f4a8c464-cbe5-4131-bd19-349dd30f292e","anchor:b159c139-b555-4d19-bda6-069ed945da90"]}]},"hotspots":[{"hotspotId":"visualhotspot:761a660e-05d2-415a-9ed7-bf822f26884f","label":"Open supporting code","destination":{"kind":"codeLens","anchor_id":"anchor:3d4357e5-4d61-4f9a-8874-54067e29a199"}},{"hotspotId":"visualhotspot:85d466e0-e164-494e-9376-6d97ba615114","label":"Open supporting code","destination":{"kind":"codeLens","anchor_id":"anchor:3da2844e-0662-43c6-9dda-b39f00df7a42"}},{"hotspotId":"visualhotspot:7486ce23-c051-4e3a-a06e-6b0ea3d1eace","label":"Open supporting code","destination":{"kind":"codeLens","anchor_id":"anchor:3da2844e-0662-43c6-9dda-b39f00df7a42"}},{"hotspotId":"visualhotspot:9cfc8732-5ddf-4121-b60b-75dd47fc65fe","label":"Open supporting code","destination":{"kind":"codeLens","anchor_id":"anchor:b159c139-b555-4d19-bda6-069ed945da90"}}]},{"sectionId":"section:b2c86701-3e58-405b-801d-37b9152a99a9","sectionRevisionId":"sectionrev:b6a80258-f00e-43cc-9a40-9eeaac06ea4f","order":1,"title":"Tax-rate validation and composition","prose":"`totalWithTax` first checks that `taxRate` is finite and non-negative, raising `RangeError` for an invalid rate. If that check passes, it evaluates `subtotal(prices) * (1 + taxRate)`, so the subtotal's price guard can still raise its own error. The shown functions return computed numbers rather than storing a cart.","spokenText":"The rate is checked before the calculation. If it passes, the function multiplies the subtotal by one plus the rate, while a bad price can still fail in the subtotal calculation.","claims":[{"claimId":"claim:78311c03-4c1b-4728-81cd-de2260819934","category":{"kind":"codeBehavior"},"prose":"`totalWithTax` accepts `prices` and `taxRate` and declares a numeric return value.","anchors":[{"anchorId":"anchor:ef113950-6bb0-47e4-a335-9af50a2fefbf","path":"cart.ts","symbolId":null,"snapshotId":"snap-1792133675714600000-43528-0","sourceSha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a","startByte":258,"endByteInclusive":330,"startLine":8,"endLine":8,"startColumn":1,"endColumn":73,"excerpt":"export function totalWithTax(prices: number[], taxRate: number): number {"}],"dependencies":[{"kind":"sourceFile","path":"cart.ts","source_sha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a"}]},{"claimId":"claim:9dedb010-2ecd-4ca1-97ad-4ad254308e43","category":{"kind":"codeBehavior"},"prose":"Before reaching its return, `totalWithTax` rejects a non-finite or negative `taxRate` by throwing `RangeError`.","anchors":[{"anchorId":"anchor:ee75dc09-88f0-4320-81b4-4d411863772c","path":"cart.ts","symbolId":"sym:e88f6d3de4018b4f516729605801d57bcc72685c6e6635e37cc8772affe0010a","snapshotId":"snap-1792133675714600000-43528-0","sourceSha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a","startByte":332,"endByteInclusive":454,"startLine":9,"endLine":11,"startColumn":1,"endColumn":3,"excerpt":"  if (!Number.isFinite(taxRate) || taxRate < 0) {\n    throw new RangeError(\"Tax rate must be finite and non-negative\");\n  }"},{"anchorId":"anchor:edfa279c-cdff-40b8-b4b2-1d09f3ae7d7d","path":"cart.ts","symbolId":"sym:e88f6d3de4018b4f516729605801d57bcc72685c6e6635e37cc8772affe0010a","snapshotId":"snap-1792133675714600000-43528-0","sourceSha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a","startByte":456,"endByteInclusive":497,"startLine":12,"endLine":12,"startColumn":1,"endColumn":42,"excerpt":"  return subtotal(prices) * (1 + taxRate);"}],"dependencies":[{"kind":"sourceFile","path":"cart.ts","source_sha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a"},{"kind":"symbol","path":"cart.ts","source_sha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a","symbol_id":"sym:e88f6d3de4018b4f516729605801d57bcc72685c6e6635e37cc8772affe0010a"}]},{"claimId":"claim:a551f32f-c6ad-4360-ba91-8660b4efce2a","category":{"kind":"codeBehavior"},"prose":"Once the rate check passes, `totalWithTax` returns `subtotal(prices) * (1 + taxRate)`. `subtotal` throws `RangeError` for any non-finite or negative price; otherwise, its reduction result is used by the multiplication.","anchors":[{"anchorId":"anchor:340e4844-3c16-449b-bbe0-567c5db56d10","path":"cart.ts","symbolId":"sym:e88f6d3de4018b4f516729605801d57bcc72685c6e6635e37cc8772affe0010a","snapshotId":"snap-1792133675714600000-43528-0","sourceSha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a","startByte":456,"endByteInclusive":497,"startLine":12,"endLine":12,"startColumn":1,"endColumn":42,"excerpt":"  return subtotal(prices) * (1 + taxRate);"},{"anchorId":"anchor:2d8fc2d5-b9f3-4e7f-865a-2d7b0b4032bd","path":"cart.ts","symbolId":"sym:3502e10e881a48270a94a5f3a3f9ae96a41c5fa4541c59b5104ffd26f244bbbe","snapshotId":"snap-1792133675714600000-43528-0","sourceSha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a","startByte":53,"endByteInclusive":193,"startLine":2,"endLine":4,"startColumn":1,"endColumn":3,"excerpt":"  if (prices.some((price) => !Number.isFinite(price) || price < 0)) {\n    throw new RangeError(\"Prices must be finite and non-negative\");\n  }"},{"anchorId":"anchor:28e3a694-66bf-4987-bf08-da54d4be06db","path":"cart.ts","symbolId":"sym:3502e10e881a48270a94a5f3a3f9ae96a41c5fa4541c59b5104ffd26f244bbbe","snapshotId":"snap-1792133675714600000-43528-0","sourceSha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a","startByte":195,"endByteInclusive":253,"startLine":5,"endLine":5,"startColumn":1,"endColumn":59,"excerpt":"  return prices.reduce((total, price) => total + price, 0);"}],"dependencies":[{"kind":"sourceFile","path":"cart.ts","source_sha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a"},{"kind":"symbol","path":"cart.ts","source_sha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a","symbol_id":"sym:e88f6d3de4018b4f516729605801d57bcc72685c6e6635e37cc8772affe0010a"},{"kind":"symbol","path":"cart.ts","source_sha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a","symbol_id":"sym:3502e10e881a48270a94a5f3a3f9ae96a41c5fa4541c59b5104ffd26f244bbbe"}]},{"claimId":"claim:48fbe1fa-2113-4ef0-b5ae-182e92f6775f","category":{"kind":"inference","visible_label":"Inference","basis":"The supplied function bodies show guards and return expressions but no storage target; static source cannot establish the runtime effects of invoked operations."},"prose":"Neither selected function contains an explicit write to stored cart state: `subtotal` derives a result from `prices`, and `totalWithTax` returns a calculation from `prices` and `taxRate`. This is a bounded observation of the shown bodies, not proof that invoked operations have no runtime effects.","anchors":[{"anchorId":"anchor:e8cd6728-d79f-4fc8-9591-d48fe4b2c4c6","path":"cart.ts","symbolId":null,"snapshotId":"snap-1792133675714600000-43528-0","sourceSha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a","startByte":0,"endByteInclusive":255,"startLine":1,"endLine":6,"startColumn":1,"endColumn":1,"excerpt":"export function subtotal(prices: number[]): number {\n  if (prices.some((price) => !Number.isFinite(price) || price < 0)) {\n    throw new RangeError(\"Prices must be finite and non-negative\");\n  }\n  return prices.reduce((total, price) => total + price, 0);\n}"},{"anchorId":"anchor:70a083a6-06e4-4773-b334-c53cdd2b364e","path":"cart.ts","symbolId":null,"snapshotId":"snap-1792133675714600000-43528-0","sourceSha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a","startByte":258,"endByteInclusive":499,"startLine":8,"endLine":13,"startColumn":1,"endColumn":1,"excerpt":"export function totalWithTax(prices: number[], taxRate: number): number {\n  if (!Number.isFinite(taxRate) || taxRate < 0) {\n    throw new RangeError(\"Tax rate must be finite and non-negative\");\n  }\n  return subtotal(prices) * (1 + taxRate);\n}"}],"dependencies":[{"kind":"sourceFile","path":"cart.ts","source_sha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a"}]}],"dependencies":[{"kind":"sourceFile","path":"cart.ts","source_sha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a"},{"kind":"symbol","path":"cart.ts","source_sha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a","symbol_id":"sym:e88f6d3de4018b4f516729605801d57bcc72685c6e6635e37cc8772affe0010a"},{"kind":"symbol","path":"cart.ts","source_sha256":"bd1859f143bc0f6eb5858ea58da490c7844b91602b5ca19e614e1d46c8f2680a","symbol_id":"sym:3502e10e881a48270a94a5f3a3f9ae96a41c5fa4541c59b5104ffd26f244bbbe"}],"visual":{"schemaVersion":2,"kind":"dataFlow","title":"Rate check, subtotal, and taxed result","layoutHint":{"direction":"leftToRight"},"nodes":[{"nodeId":"visualnode:94b44309-9c7f-4619-9aee-b7405c3d0cd5","label":"Inputs","detail":"prices array and taxRate","hotspotId":"visualhotspot:129bb220-02ae-46a4-a5bd-b3a70bb1c842","evidenceAnchorIds":["anchor:ef113950-6bb0-47e4-a335-9af50a2fefbf"]},{"nodeId":"visualnode:d7514e2b-cfe0-44f7-b5e9-1057777eee8f","label":"Rate check","detail":"Require a finite, non-negative taxRate","hotspotId":"visualhotspot:36201c6e-ad57-42db-86a2-156d286e7295","evidenceAnchorIds":["anchor:ee75dc09-88f0-4320-81b4-4d411863772c"]},{"nodeId":"visualnode:dddabc01-9872-4127-99c8-f74515b050e5","label":"Rate RangeError","detail":"Invalid rate is rejected","hotspotId":"visualhotspot:ebeca8e0-d196-4e62-9ea3-2d5af7968e1f","evidenceAnchorIds":["anchor:ee75dc09-88f0-4320-81b4-4d411863772c"]},{"nodeId":"visualnode:09d93b37-06de-4816-83b6-f484d9666b3a","label":"subtotal(prices)","detail":"Call subtotal, which checks the prices","hotspotId":"visualhotspot:1df4fe2f-b36d-424c-8ad3-5fe6cf68541d","evidenceAnchorIds":["anchor:340e4844-3c16-449b-bbe0-567c5db56d10","anchor:2d8fc2d5-b9f3-4e7f-865a-2d7b0b4032bd"]},{"nodeId":"visualnode:2342cabb-e05d-4cf8-b410-cfda620f9da5","label":"Price RangeError","detail":"Invalid price is rejected by subtotal","hotspotId":"vi